{"seq":3,"slug":"biopharmaceuticals-food","title":"生物医药与食品制造","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biopharmaceuticals-food","wordCount":1863,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物医药与食品制造\">生物医药与食品制造</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>生物医药与食品是生物制造中附加值最高、监管最严格的两大领域。从抗体药物到mRNA疫苗，从精密发酵替代蛋白到功能性食品配料，生物制造正在重塑人类健康与营养体系的底层生产逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"抗体药物生产-cho细胞平台\">抗体药物生产（CHO细胞平台）</h3><p>单克隆抗体（mAb）是全球销售额最大的药物品类（2025年超$2000亿），其生产几乎完全依赖CHO（中国仓鼠卵巢）细胞平台。</p>\n<p><strong>CHO平台优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>人源化糖基化修饰能力</li>\n<li>可在无血清悬浮培养中高密度生长</li>\n<li>成熟的监管审批记录（&gt;70%已批准生物药使用CHO）</li>\n<li>分泌表达，简化下游纯化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>产量进化</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>典型滴度</th>\n<th>关键突破</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1990s</td>\n<td>0.1-0.5 g/L</td>\n<td>基础培养基优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000s</td>\n<td>1-3 g/L</td>\n<td>高表达载体、培养基迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2010s</td>\n<td>5-10 g/L</td>\n<td>高密度灌注、筛选优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2020s</td>\n<td>10-15 g/L</td>\n<td>AI培养基设计、高拷贝整合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键工程环节</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>细胞系开发</strong>：位点特异性整合（如AAVS1位点）确保表达稳定性</li>\n<li><strong>克隆筛选</strong>：单细胞克隆→微型反应器放大→Top克隆确认</li>\n<li><strong>培养工艺</strong>：Fed-batch（14天，滴度5-10 g/L）或连续灌注（60天+，体积生产力更高）</li>\n<li><strong>糖基化控制</strong>：唾液酸化程度影响半衰期，岩藻糖水平影响ADCC效应</li>\n</ol>\n<p>比生产力公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mi>X</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>pg/cell/day，典型值20-80 pcd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_P = \\frac{\\Delta P}{\\int_0^t X \\cdot dt} \\quad (\\text{pg/cell/day，典型值20-80 pcd})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5946em;vertical-align:-1.2343em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9885em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3442em;margin-left:-0.1945em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3558em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2343em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pg/cell/day</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，典型值</span><span class=\"mord\">20-80 pcd</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"mrna疫苗制造\">mRNA疫苗制造</h3><p>COVID-19疫苗的成功使mRNA技术从研发型平台跃升为全球制造型平台。</p>\n<p><strong>生产流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>质粒DNA制备</strong>：大肠杆菌发酵→碱裂解→色谱纯化→线性化</li>\n<li><strong>体外转录（IVT）</strong>：T7 RNA聚合酶催化转录，N1-甲基假尿嘧啶核苷（m1Ψ）替代天然尿苷降低免疫原性</li>\n<li><strong>加帽与PolyA</strong>：酶法5&#39;-Cap1加帽+poly(A)尾修饰</li>\n<li><strong>纯化</strong>：HPLC或亲和色谱去除dsRNA杂质（dsRNA触发先天免疫）</li>\n<li><strong>LNP封装</strong>：脂质纳米颗粒（可电离脂质+胆固醇+PEG-脂质+DSPC）通过微流控混合</li>\n</ol>\n<p>IVT反应产率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>产率</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> mg mRNA/mL反应体积</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{产率} \\approx 2-5\\ \\text{mg mRNA/mL反应体积}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">产率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg mRNA/mL</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">反应体积</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>规模化挑战</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>mRNA不稳定（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-20°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">20°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>或<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-70°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">70°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>冷链）</li>\n<li>LNP均匀性要求颗粒尺寸<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80 \\pm 20\\ \\text{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，PDI&lt;0.2</li>\n<li>分析方法开发：完整性（电泳）、加帽率（LC-MS）、dsRNA含量</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"精密发酵-precision-fermentation\">精密发酵（Precision Fermentation）</h3><p>精密发酵使用工程化微生物生产传统上只能从动物获取的蛋白质与脂肪：</p>\n<p><strong>替代蛋白领域</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>微生物平台</th>\n<th>目标蛋白</th>\n<th>商业化状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无动物乳清蛋白</td>\n<td><em>K. lactis</em> / <em>Trichoderma</em></td>\n<td>β-乳球蛋白</td>\n<td>Perfect Day（已商业化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无动物酪蛋白</td>\n<td><em>P. pastoris</em></td>\n<td>αs1-酪蛋白</td>\n<td>New Culture（中试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无动物卵白蛋白</td>\n<td><em>T. reesei</em></td>\n<td>卵白蛋白</td>\n<td>The EVERY Company（已商业化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无动物胶原蛋白</td>\n<td><em>P. pastoris</em> / 植物</td>\n<td>I/III型胶原</td>\n<td>Geltor（已商业化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>培养肉（Cultivated Meat）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>动物细胞体外大规模培养→组织工程→肉类产品</li>\n<li>核心挑战：培养基成本（原&gt;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi><mtext>，</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年前沿方案降至</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300/L，2026年前沿方案降至&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年前沿方案降至</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span>5/L通过回收与精密发酵生长因子）</li>\n<li>2025年新加坡、美国已批准商业销售；2026年中国进入监管沙盒</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>比较优势</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>精密发酵用水量</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>畜牧业用水量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{精密发酵用水量} \\approx \\frac{1}{10} \\times \\text{畜牧业用水量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">精密发酵用水量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">畜牧业用水量</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>精密发酵土地占用</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>畜牧业土地</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{精密发酵土地占用} \\approx \\frac{1}{100} \\times \\text{畜牧业土地}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">精密发酵土地占用</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">畜牧业土地</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"功能性食品配料生物合成\">功能性食品配料生物合成</h3><p>微生物发酵生产高附加值食品成分，替代提取法或化学合成：</p>\n<p><strong>母乳低聚糖（HMO）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2&#39;-岩藻糖基乳糖（2&#39;-FL）：工程化大肠杆菌利用乳糖和GDP-岩藻糖合成</li>\n<li>全球年产&gt;10,000吨（DSM/Glycom、GenMont）</li>\n<li>2026年第三代HMO（LNT、LNnT、3-FL组合）进入商业化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>稀有糖</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>D-阿洛酮糖（Allulose）：热量仅蔗糖的1/10，工程化酶将果糖异构化为阿洛酮糖</li>\n<li>塔格糖（Tagatose）：半乳糖异构化产物，GI仅为3</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>类胡萝卜素与维生素</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>β-胡萝卜素：<em>Blakeslea trispora</em>发酵已工业化</li>\n<li>虾青素：<em>Haematococcus</em>微藻培养或工程化大肠杆菌</li>\n<li>维生素B₁₂：唯有微生物发酵能生产（化学合成步骤过多不经济）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>天然香精</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>香兰素：工程化酵母从阿魏酸生产——Evolva/IFF合作项目年产千吨级</li>\n<li>橙花叔醇（Nerolidol）：萜类香料的微生物发酵路线</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;精密发酵&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;替代蛋白(乳清/卵白/胶原)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;功能性配料(HMO/稀有糖)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;天然香精(香兰素/萜类)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;色素(类胡萝卜素)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;乳制品替代&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;肉类替代&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H[&quot;婴儿配方&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; I[&quot;健康食品&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"精密发酵\"] --&gt; B[\"替代蛋白(乳清/卵白/胶原)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"功能性配料(HMO/稀有糖)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"天然香精(香兰素/萜类)\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"色素(类胡萝卜素)\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"乳制品替代\"]\n    B --&gt; G[\"肉类替代\"]\n    C --&gt; H[\"婴儿配方\"]\n    C --&gt; I[\"健康食品\"]</pre><h3 id=\"监管与安全\">监管与安全</h3><p>生物制造食品面临独特的监管挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新型食品法规（Novel Food）</strong>：EU法规(EC) 2015/2283要求安全性评估</li>\n<li><strong>GRAS认定</strong>（美国FDA）：Generally Recognized as Safe，可自我声明或申请FDA确认</li>\n<li><strong>精密发酵产品标签</strong>：是否需标注&quot;基因工程生产&quot;因国家而异</li>\n<li><strong>过敏原管理</strong>：重组蛋白是否携带原始来源的过敏原性需要临床验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年生物医药与食品制造重要进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Moderna建成全球首个端到端连续mRNA生产线（澳大利亚），从质粒发酵到LNP灌装无人干预运行</li>\n<li>中国药监局批准首个连续制造生物药申报——某PD-1抗体连续灌注工艺获准</li>\n<li>Perfect Day乳清蛋白获中国新食品原料批准，正式进入中国市场</li>\n<li>精密发酵生长因子成本突破：Multus Media报道FGF-2发酵成本降至<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext>（</mtext><mn>2019</mn><mtext>年为</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.50/mg（2019年为</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">2019</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年为</span></span></span></span></span>500/mg），使培养肉培养基成本首次降至$10/L以下</li>\n<li>全球首个&quot;基因工程食品原料&quot;统一标签框架由Codex Alimentarius发布</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>CHO细胞抗体滴度从1990s的0.5 g/L提升到当前的10+ g/L，主要归因于哪些技术进步？接下来的产量天花板可能在哪里？</li>\n<li>mRNA疫苗的生产为什么特别适合&quot;平台化&quot;？即同一生产线快速切换不同mRNA产品。分析其与传统疫苗生产的本质区别。</li>\n<li>精密发酵的乳清蛋白与天然牛乳清蛋白在分子层面有什么异同？从蛋白序列、翻译后修饰、功能性三个维度比较。</li>\n<li>培养肉的核心经济瓶颈已从&quot;是否可行&quot;转为&quot;成本能否达标&quot;。分析培养基成本从<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi><mtext>降至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300/L降至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降至</span></span></span></span></span>5/L需要哪些关键技术突破。</li>\n<li>如果你是一家精密发酵初创公司CEO，要在2027年推出一款新产品进入中国市场，你会选择什么产品？从技术难度、监管路径、市场需求三个维度论证。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生物医药与食品制造代表了生物制造的高附加值前沿。CHO细胞平台与mRNA技术已成为全球生物药生产的两大支柱，连续制造正在重塑其经济学。精密发酵开辟了&quot;不养牛产牛奶、不养鸡产蛋白&quot;的新纪元，HMO与稀有糖等功能性配料则展示了微生物在人类营养精准化中的独特价值。这一领域技术迭代速度快、监管环境持续演进、商业化窗口正在打开——是生物制造工程师最具职业吸引力的方向之一。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物医药与食品制造","id":"生物医药与食品制造"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"抗体药物生产（CHO细胞平台）","id":"抗体药物生产-cho细胞平台"},{"level":3,"text":"mRNA疫苗制造","id":"mrna疫苗制造"},{"level":3,"text":"精密发酵（Precision Fermentation）","id":"精密发酵-precision-fermentation"},{"level":3,"text":"功能性食品配料生物合成","id":"功能性食品配料生物合成"},{"level":3,"text":"监管与安全","id":"监管与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生物材料与生物塑料","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biomaterials-bioplastics"},"next":null}